{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJFigureEight","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QIntegerCanonical"],"declarations":22,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.coloredJonesTrefoil_qholonomic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.coloredJonesTrefoil_qholonomic","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L176-L183","doc":"**Derived (conditional on the literature class): the trefoil tower is\nq-holonomic at every `q = w⁴`, `w ≠ 0`** — ∃-packaging as for `4₁`.\nNote `w ≠ 0 → w⁴ ≠ 0` supplies the nontriviality hypothesis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator_nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator_nontrivial","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L152-L165","doc":"**Nontriviality, proved** (char 0): witness `m = 2/q` — a single\nwitness suffices (`mq = 2 ≠ 1`), no case split. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trUnit_nondegenerate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trUnit_nondegenerate","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L144-L150","doc":"The unit factor is not identically zero (witness `M = 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator_specializes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator_specializes","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L132-L142","doc":"**Specialization, proved**: `−(M²−1)/M⁴·L − (M²−1)/M¹⁰\n= (1−M²)/M¹⁰ · (1 + L·M⁶)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.specializes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.specializes","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L128-L128","doc":"**Specialization, meridian-squared convention**: at `q = 1`,\n`m = M²`, the homogeneous part equals `unit M · A_{3₁}(L, M)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.unit_nondegenerate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.unit_nondegenerate","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L125-L125","doc":"The unit factor is not identically zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.unit","kind":"def","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L123-L123","doc":"The strong-AJ unit factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.annihilates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.annihilates","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L120-L120","doc":"Annihilates the trefoil tower at every `w ≠ 0` (with `q = w⁴`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.nontrivial","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L118-L118","doc":"Non-trivial at every `q ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.order_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.order_eq","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L116-L116","doc":"The inhomogeneous presentation has order 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.op","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.op","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L114-L114","doc":"The annihilating operator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil.mk","kind":"ctor","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L112-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.StrongAJTrefoil","kind":"class","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L109-L130","doc":"**Strong AJ for the trefoil (§3b class; literature theorem).**\nFields mirror `StrongAJFigureEight`, at order 1, against the concrete\nRosso–Jones tower (parameterized by `w`, `q = w⁴`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trUnit","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L105-L107","doc":"The strong-AJ unit factor of the trefoil specialization:\n`(1 − M²)/M¹⁰`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.aPolyTrefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.aPolyTrefoil","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L101-L103","doc":"The classical A-polynomial of the (left-handed) trefoil:\n`A_{3₁}(L, M) = 1 + L·M⁶` (CCGLS tables, nonabelian component). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L95-L99","doc":"The explicit trefoil annihilator as a `QDifferenceOperator`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trRhs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trRhs","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L92-L93","doc":"Inhomogeneous part: `b = −q(m²q − 1)/m⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trCoeff","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L84-L90","doc":"Coefficient functions of the explicit trefoil annihilator, transcribed\nverbatim from the verified reconstruction (order 1;\n`a₀ = −(m−1)/m⁵`, `a₁ = −q(mq−1)/m²`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.coloredJonesTrefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.coloredJonesTrefoil","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L73-L82","doc":"The N-colored Jones tower of the (left-handed) trefoil `T(2,3)` —\nRosso–Jones twist-eigenvalue sum for the closure of `σ₁³` in `B₂`,\nwith the framing correction `θ^{−3} = w^{−3n(n+2)}`.  Conventions\nself-anchored corpus-side (`J₁ = 1`, `J₂ = V(3₁)` exact). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.twistEigenvalue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.twistEigenvalue","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L67-L71","doc":"Twist eigenvalue of the braiding on the `V_{2j}` summand of\n`V_n ⊗ V_n`, at `w = q^{1/4}`:\n`T_j = (−1)^{n−j} · w^{2j(j+1) − n(n+2)}` (a `ℤ`-power). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.qInt_eq_canonical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.qInt_eq_canonical","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L59-L65","doc":"**Bridge to the canonical balanced bracket.** The alias was refused —\na proof below needs this literal body — so the consolidation is this\nequation: same function, one canonical meaning, no proof touched. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.qInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.qInt","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoil.lean#L56-L57","doc":"Quantum integer `[k]_v = (v^k − v^{−k})/(v − v⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}